Across South Wales, thousands of small businesses are operating without a professional website — or with one that was built years ago and hasn't been touched since. Both situations cost real money in missed enquiries, lost search visibility, and customers who choose a competitor they could find online.

A managed starter website is designed to fix that — quickly, affordably, and without any technical hassle on your side.

## Why Local Businesses in South Wales Need a Strong Website

When someone in Cardiff searches for a plumber, when someone in Newport looks for a local roofer, or when someone in Merthyr Tydfil needs a decorator, they search on Google. The businesses that appear at the top of those results get the calls. The ones that don't appear miss out entirely.

A well-built website — one that's properly structured, optimised for local search, and consistently growing — is how you make sure your business is in that first group, not the second.

For more on how websites drive local enquiries, see [can a managed starter website rank on Google](/blog/can-a-managed-starter-website-rank-on-google/).

## What's Included in Our Managed Starter Website Service

Our [managed starter website service](/services/managed-starter-websites/) gives South Wales businesses a complete online presence — built, hosted, and managed for you:

**Professional website build** — Your site is designed and written for you. You provide the basics about your business; we handle the design, copy, and structure.

**Domain and hosting included** — Your own domain name registered and hosted on fast, reliable servers with SSL and daily backups.

**Monthly page additions** — Every month, new pages are added to your site. These target your services, your locations, and the questions your customers are searching for. Over time, this grows your site's Google presence significantly.

**Small changes included** — Update your phone number, add a new service, swap a photo — just ask and it's done.

**Fully managed** — Software updates, security, performance — all handled. You don't need to think about any of it.

## Who It's Built For

Our managed starter website service is particularly well suited to:

- **Tradespeople** — Roofers, plumbers, electricians, builders, painters and decorators who need to be found locally on Google
- **Sole traders and new businesses** — Getting online quickly and affordably without a large upfront cost
- **Established businesses without a website** — Or with an outdated one that isn't generating enquiries
- **Businesses wanting low-cost growth** — The monthly page additions model builds search visibility consistently over time

For tradespeople specifically, see [managed starter websites for tradespeople](/blog/managed-starter-websites-for-tradespeople/).

